WEBVTT

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:16.490
October, 771, New Holy Era
Fairie Tour Prison

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:24.690
Hey, you! What are you planning to do to Marius?!

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:29.190
What kind of joke is it that he's a witch?!
He's a man, and just a page!

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:31.350
Quit your hollering, and get back!

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:40.190
What am I doing? I am sworn to protect
my friends and everything else.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.480
What's all the racket?

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.810
Commander Lucan...

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:46.810
Lucan?

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:51.850
You're the new prisoner I heard about?

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:55.980
The lord in league with the petridermic
witch and plotting a rebellion,

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:57.810
Alfred Albert?

00:00:57.810 --> 00:00:59.270
It can't be...

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:03.560
Lucan, Squad 5 Commander of the Royal Order?

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:05.060
Why are you here?

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:06.980
You two know each other?

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:10.650
Then in light of your friendship,
you can let us out of here, right?

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:12.810
Don't be ridiculous!

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:19.140
"Fairie Tour Prison, 
Captain of the Guard"
"Lucan de Luch"

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:15.940
Commander Lucan is the captain of the guard at this prison.

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:19.400
Huh? What are the royal knights doing?

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:25.480
Lucan, I need to discuss with you how
to save Marius, our treasured friend!

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:26.480
Please!

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.690
It won't help.

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:31.690
The witch is to be executed.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:37.150
You two are also being
moved to the Tower of Justice,

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:39.100
where you will be sentenced.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:40.900
I know you can see what is happening!

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:42.900
How there is no justice to this witch hunt!

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:46.060
Take them away.

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:47.980
Why, you! Get back here!

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:50.150
You dog of the Orthodox Church!

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:52.900
Marius...!

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:34.310
I understood it, too--what he was trying to protect.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:38.480
To keep everyone in Albert safe,

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:41.400
he was trying to fulfill his duty as their lord,

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:45.270
even while struggling over how best to do so.

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:47.190
And yet, I...

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:53.900
...with my self-centered intentions,
dragged him into the middle of this fight.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:58.440
This isn't what I wanted, either!
I wanted everyone to be happy,

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:03.020
and at peace!
I wanted to keep everyone safe, too!

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:04.600
Is that really what you wanted?

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:07.190
Huh? Charlot?

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:12.190
Were you really trying to keep everyone safe?
Do you want their happiness?

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:15.940
I've always considered
what's best for the kingdom.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:18.400
Charlot, that goes for you, too.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:21.770
You're only thinking about yourself, Sister.

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:28.150
That isn't true! I'm ready to lay down
my life to protect the others!

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:32.650
Then why haven't you come to save me?

00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:38.940
I'm here, locked up inside the castle,
all alone and afraid.

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:41.770
How can you claim a life of peace for yourself

00:04:41.770 --> 00:04:45.310
while they take it out on us
so you can go on living?

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:47.690
I-I...

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:50.190
He's coming again.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:56.310
Tell me, why won't you save me?

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.520
Our father...

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.690
...and Fernando...

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:02.730
...and Leon are all dead.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:04.770
Save me, Sister.

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:07.400
Please...

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:09.520
Save--

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:13.850
Stop...

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:16.020
Just stop already!

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:23.520
Tell me! Where are your witch friends?!

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.810
How do you lift the petridermic curse?!

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:31.650
It looks like she's set on not talking to us.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.150
That is enough.

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:41.400
Sir Didier!

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:48.560
Torturing her any further will do no good.
I will take over from here.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:49.730
Yes, sir.

00:05:57.150 --> 00:06:01.480
I am terribly sorry for this harsh treatment...

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:03.190
...Princess Marielle.

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:23.230
Why, you...!

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:28.850
Hey, now what are we gonna do?

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:30.100
We're going to rescue Marius!

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.310
That's crazy!

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:33.940
You want us to do nothing but wait
for Marius to be executed?!

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:36.810
No, but do you think we can escape?

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:38.770
Hey, you! What are you doing?!

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:39.750
There, you see?

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:40.350
Hold it!

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:48.940
I apologize on behalf of my men for their
barbaric treatment, Princess Marielle.

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:55.150
Ecclesiastical Knights are useful pawns,
but due to their overly-deep faith,

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:57.980
they have a tendency to act a bit fanatical.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:01.690
I have to say, though,

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:04.980
I cannot believe I did not
recognize you as the princess.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:09.020
As a knight who has long sworn
allegiance in service to the kingdom,

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:10.850
it was an unworthy error on my part.

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:13.980
How can you say that, after usurping
the kingdom, you traitor?

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:15.600
Unfortunately for you,

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:19.060
King Charlot has decreed a severe punishment

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:22.100
for the witch attempting
to bring down the kingdom.

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:25.060
That's only what the pope told him to say!

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:26.520
Is it?

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.850
For the crime of turning against us,

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:37.350
you will pay with your life.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.150
However...

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:46.190
It would be more than I could bear
to let you die without knowing the truth.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:47.730
The truth?

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.400
It is the least I can do to pay tribute.

00:07:56.150 --> 00:07:58.190
Are these...

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:00.270
...my memories?

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:02.400
My recollections of Mother?

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:12.690
I'll watch over Charlot.

00:08:12.690 --> 00:08:16.100
So don't cry, Mother.

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:19.650
Thank you, Marielle.

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:24.020
I am so very happy to have you for a daughter.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.940
Mother!

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:37.980
What is this memory?

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:44.770
Now, Your Majesty, concentrate hard on the relic.

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:48.270
Your wishes... Your desires...

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:50.060
Mother?

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:53.980
What is Father doing, exactly?

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:55.810
Black Knight?

00:08:55.810 --> 00:09:00.310
You should not be here, Princess.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:02.100
What is going on in there?

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:07.400
His Majesty is in intense grief
over losing Queen Éléanore.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:13.560
He is now offering a prayer to summon
the queen back down from Heaven.

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:19.440
I miss Mother, too. But,

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:22.270
once someone passes away, they don't come back.

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:24.400
That is not true.

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:25.810
Huh?

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:29.730
There is a great power in our world that transcends

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:31.690
the laws of all creation.

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:41.560
What was that just now? I never knew about this.

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:46.770
At my suggestion, your memories
of that day have been locked away.

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:49.020
This great power...

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:53.270
The previous king, your father,
was captivated by this power,

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:55.350
and committed a taboo.

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:59.480
That is when the kingdom began to fall.

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:01.350
Rugis's revolt,

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:04.600
the monsters that suddenly
started appearing in our world,

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:08.020
the young king, who has
become a puppet of the pope--

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:12.440
all of them were brought about by your father.

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:18.690
That's not true... That's not true...

00:10:18.690 --> 00:10:21.560
Bringing his beloved wife back to life--

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:23.600
that self-righteous wish is what ended up

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:27.480
bringing this misery upon
the people of the kingdom.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.150
Come to think of it,

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:34.900
I understand that sanctions
against Albert will be coming soon.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:37.850
When it comes to bringing
misfortune upon the people,

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:40.980
you must take after your father.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:45.150
Come...

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:49.100
Allow me to show you to your final performance.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:55.810
Damn!

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:57.770
That's far enough! Give yourselves up!

00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:00.940
I guess this is it.

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:06.020
What the...?

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:07.520
Are they going after each other?

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.440
It's me! Sorry I'm late.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:11.650
Maurice! Then that means...

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:10.270
Pops!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.480
Catch <i>moru</i> !

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:19.520
Alfred!

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:20.560
Qoo!

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:22.980
I was so worried <i>moru</i> !

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:25.400
Sorry, Qoo. I knew you'd come through.

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:26.900
Nice work, you little monster!

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.690
Marius is at the Execution Ground!

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:35.270
Apparently so.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:38.690
If only I had gotten inside here sooner...

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:42.900
But why are they in such a rush to get rid of Marius?

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:45.150
And for being a witch?

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:46.600
He's...

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:56.400
I cannot allow you to pass.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:12:01.690
Ho, it's been a long time, Lucan.
I'd heard some stories,

00:12:01.690 --> 00:12:05.020
but you really have become a full-blown
watchdog of the Orthodox Church.

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:08.440
Maurice, leading a prison break?

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:10.230
How far you have fallen.

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:13.730
I don't want to hear it, coming from a royal knight

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:15.600
who has lost his pride.

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:17.900
You think you know what's going on?!

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:23.850
Come on, what's the matter?!

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:28.520
Is this the spear work of
someone who's lost his way?!

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:32.690
Silence! You ran away after the revolt!

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:34.810
What right do you have to say anything?!

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:39.230
The kingdom has been usurped by the pope,

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:41.690
and the princess's life has been snuffed out.

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:45.810
There is no longer any cause for me
to devote my life to the kingdom!

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:47.850
You're in the same boat, aren't you?!

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:50.520
That's where you're wrong, Lucan!

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:57.600
I have not lost my pride, nor have I
lost the person I swear loyalty to!

00:12:57.600 --> 00:12:58.980
What?

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:02.980
The whole reason I am here now is to rescue that person!

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:08.650
Go on ahead, Alfred!

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:10.480
There's a carriage waiting for you!

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:13.350
Make sure that this rescue succeeds!

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:27.600
Ho, Squad 4 is missing in action?

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:31.310
Yes. They were out putting down
monsters when we lost contact.

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:34.100
It is not known if Commander Bertrand is still alive.

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:36.940
Very well. You are dismissed.

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:37.980
Yes, Your Holiness.

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:41.770
Hmm...

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:46.730
Earlier, Olivier also mobilized her
forces for military exercises, too.

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:51.400
It is possible that they realized
who the witch really is.

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:52.650
Didier...

00:13:52.650 --> 00:13:59.400
That would show that they have chosen her,
and not the Orthodox Church.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:02.350
Use whatever means necessary to dispose of them--

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:05.690
that goes for everyone who supports her!

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:08.600
Very well, if you will forgive my haste...

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:20.020
That was the spatial shifting
that is spoken of in Magonian lore.

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:23.190
As usual, that knight knows no bounds.

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:25.100
I'll see to him, too, someday...

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:38.440
I bring misery upon all around me.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:41.690
All people ever do is protect me.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:45.650
I've managed to survive thanks
to the sacrifices of many others.

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:51.230
So this is for the best.

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:55.440
Now, no one else will have
to get hurt because of me.

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:04.900
Marius has been carrying something this whole time.

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:07.020
I knew there was something,

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.730
but I couldn't ever confront it!

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:12.270
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:17.270
I could have at least extended a hand to him...

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:22.100
I'm sorry, Qoo... Charlot...
I'll never see you again.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.270
It can't end like this!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:27.650
Farewell, Alfred.

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:30.900
Even if it costs me my own life,
I swear I will save you!

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:38.560
Marius!

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:41.440
Alfred!

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:46.650
I'm taking back my friend!

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:49.190
It's the lord who the witch tricked!

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:51.190
Stop them!

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:56.230
What are you doing here?

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:59.560
I made up my mind that no matter what,

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:01.270
I would protect my friends!

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:05.980
You fool.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:16.400
You would come throw your life away for a mere page?

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:19.100
Tch, this guy is a real handful.

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:20.440
It doesn't matter!

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:35.020
Just stop already.

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:37.310
I don't want to see anyone else...

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:40.980
...getting hurt on account of me!

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.600
Damn...

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:46.150
I thought you were a more sensible man than this.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:49.310
I had no idea you were such a hothead.

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:53.150
I will save Marius, no matter what it takes.
If it comes to it,

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:56.480
I don't mind if it costs me an arm or a leg!

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:07.350
You cannot beat me with sentiment alone.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:12.480
What?!

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:27.980
We're here to rescue you!

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:30.230
Guys! Why?!

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:33.600
You did it, Adel!

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:36.350
Maurice...

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:40.770
I had to run all over Hortensia to do it, though.

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:43.850
Proud knights of Hortensia!

00:17:43.850 --> 00:17:48.690
Now is the time to fight!
To preserve the fire that lights the kingdom's future!

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:52.440
Charge!

00:17:58.440 --> 00:18:00.150
Take this!

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.810
Wh-What do we do?!

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:10.400
Go on, kill her already!

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:12.520
Jim!

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:14.100
Go, Edel!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.600
You...

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:22.900
Feel the strike of my spears, their pride reborn!

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:23.850
Lucan!

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:24.810
Go!

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:27.690
Go and save the fire of hope that shines for us!

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:29.020
Thank you!

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:34.100
Are you suggesting that you are a match for me?
You give me too little credit.

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:35.440
In that case,

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:37.730
allow me to lend my assistance.

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:45.150
As a fellow Templar knight,
you will not find me lacking.

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:47.270
Adelheid...

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:51.980
Let my spear, hailed as the glory of Olivier,
be burned into your mind!

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:57.310
Stop him! Don't let him get near her!

00:18:57.310 --> 00:18:59.020
Why, you...!

00:18:59.020 --> 00:19:02.520
Keep out of Alfred's way!

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:03.520
Marius!

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:09.150
Heretic! You dare defy the Orthodox Church?!

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:19.900
Let me give you a hand, Adelheid!

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:28.810
I must carry out the witch's sentence, no matter what!

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:32.850
For Pope Vall D'Hebron!

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:35.020
Die!

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:44.480
It looks like this is the end of the road.

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:46.770
What is that?

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:50.440
You aren't getting away!

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:12.150
Why did you come?

00:20:12.150 --> 00:20:14.690
Why are you here for someone like me?

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:21.650
I've deceived you all up to now...
and brought misery upon everyone...

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:25.190
I should have just died here...

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:29.100
Don't be so grim.

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:35.770
It doesn't matter to me whoever you are.

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:37.980
You're still my precious family.

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:44.810
Let's return home together... back to our Albert.

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:07.100
Marius...

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:12.600
Alfred, there's something
I need to speak to you about.

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:19.900
I'm... I am not Marius.

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:27.100
My true name is Marielle Le Hortensia.

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:32.230
I am the missing princess of
the Kingdom of Hortensia.

00:21:32.230 --> 00:21:38.480
I had my life saved by your father
and many others.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:43.150
And yet, I haven't done anything for this country.

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:47.940
On the contrary, it was my self-righteous
attitude that dragged you...

00:21:47.940 --> 00:21:52.400
that dragged Albert into this war.

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:58.940
I really am sorry about that.
I'm not fit for the title "princess."

00:21:58.940 --> 00:22:01.980
Dad used to tell me

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:04.560
that to light up the darkness
so the people don't lose their way

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:07.900
and to burn intensely
so that they don't become frozen--

00:22:07.900 --> 00:22:13.440
to be like a flame--
was the duty of those who would rule the nation.

00:22:13.440 --> 00:22:18.730
And to preserve that flame so it never
goes out is the duty of a knight.

00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:25.310
You have always thought of the kingdom's people,

00:22:25.310 --> 00:22:30.440
and your soul has burned without fail.
And you made me realize something--

00:22:30.440 --> 00:22:32.810
what I should really be protecting.

00:22:38.850 --> 00:22:44.480
I know you can lead even more people,
and bring them happiness.

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:48.810
What the future holds in store may be rough.

00:22:48.810 --> 00:22:54.770
But even so, I will make sure to keep you safe. So...

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:57.400
I want you to be the flame that
shines the way for the people,

00:22:57.400 --> 00:22:59.980
and leads us into the future.

00:23:11.560 --> 00:23:12.850
Princess Marielle...

00:23:14.730 --> 00:23:19.020
I, Alfred Albert, swear on my sword
that you have my absolute allegiance.

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:32.050
Chapter 8

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:32.050
Lamplight

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:32.050
~The Return of the Princess~

00:23:33.690 --> 00:23:35.900
I have to size her up at once--

00:23:35.900 --> 00:23:38.190
I just can't get used to being called "Princess."

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:40.190
So that's the real story behind the witch hunts?

00:23:40.190 --> 00:23:42.100
Something in which the power of Magonia dwells.

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:43.940
I hope days like this one can go on forever.

00:23:43.940 --> 00:23:46.940
I hope days like this one can go on forever.

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
Chapter 9

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
The Witch

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
